  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T I.570 focuses on the aspect of private networks connection to a public integrated services digital network (ISDN) with ISDN user part (ISUP). This Recommendation presents public/private ISDN interworking reference configurations, scenarios for public/private ISDN interworking, service interworking and interworking requirements at point of interconnection.</abstract>
